    "description": "Mahindra Lifespace South Asia Partners is actively seeking a talented and motivated Sales Manager to join our dynamic team in Chandigarh. This is an excellent opportunity for professionals who are passionate about making a real impact in a fast-growing organization.\n\nAbout Mahindra Lifespace South Asia Partners:\nMahindra Lifespace South Asia Partners is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Achieve monthly and quarterly sales targets\n• Manage relationships with existing customers post-purchase\n• Coordinate with legal teams for documentation and title verification\n• Provide advisory services on property investment and market trends\n• Maintain a pipeline of qualified leads using CRM software\n• Prepare presentations and proposals for institutional clients\n• Build relationships with channel partners and brokers\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• CA / CMA / CFA certification\n• 3-6 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Project Management\n• Proficiency in Real Estate Law\n• Proficiency in Portfolio Management\n• Proficiency in GIS Tools\n• Proficiency in RERA Compliance\n• Proficiency in Client Relationship Management\n• Proficiency in Contract Management\n• Proficiency in MS Office\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Learning & development budget\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Salary Range: 7 LPA - 15 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Chandigarh, Punjab, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Mahindra Lifespace South Asia Partners!",
